# Sub-tick interpolation of the particle systems. Row grammar and the
# leave-one-out: see games/spyro-1/corpus/particles-subtick-corpus.manifest.
#
# shady-oasis-flame: the sparks the flame breath throws off the oasis rock.
# The row names the larger of the two established puffs, 302 px at 1421 against
# 382 px at 1423, which crosses 4.1 px over the interval. At V=1421 the same
# puff had just spawned and resolves to no component at 1419, which is why the
# row sits one tick later.
shady-oasis-flame.bk2 | 1423 | blob=296.8,188.3 tol=0.5 step=4
#
# crushs-dungeon: the star burst an HP loss throws, sixteen
# fixed-layer records (class 5 and up) whose corners the game places in view
# space with no camera term. The row names the burst, 1486-1544 px, which
# crosses 1.6 px over the interval; its own extent ramps with it, so `step`
# sits below the compact feeders' default.
crushs-dungeon.bk2 | 2157 | blob=195.4,347.4 tol=0.5 step=0.5
